---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /blog/
title: Blog
pageDescription: Short essays on leading, deciding, and staying human as AI moves deeper into the work - notes from The AI Leader's Mind by Gaurav Srivastava.
---
<section class="section"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">Blog</div>
  <h1>Notes on leading beside the machine</h1>
  <p class="lead">Short essays on judgment, trust, and the inner work of leading in an AI-driven world. Drawn from the thinking behind <em>{{ site.title }}</em>.</p>
  <div class="rule"><span></span></div>
  <div class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <a class="post-item" href="{{ post.url }}">
      <div class="date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</div>
      <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ post.data.pageDescription }}</p>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div></section>
